      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why it scales:\n• ≤ N uncommitted messages per pod\n• rebalance/crash replays ≤ N\n• paused buckets cost nothing\n• each message read ≤ ~2 times\n• head of a bucket is the next due,\n  so one cached deliverAt per bucket\n  is enough to know when to wake",
      "originalText": "Why it scales:\n• ≤ N uncommitted messages per pod\n• rebalance/crash replays ≤ N\n• paused buckets cost nothing\n• each message read ≤ ~2 times\n• head of a bucket is the next due,\n  so one cached deliverAt per bucket\n  is enough to know when to wake",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
